                <p>We take care to minimize the collection of personal information to only what is necessary for the purposes described in this policy. When you interact with us for a one-time service, we will only request information that is directly relevant to that service. When you create an ongoing account relationship with us, we will collect only the information needed to maintain that relationship and provide you with the features and services associated with your account type.</p>
