                <p>You may opt out of usage data collection through the Software settings or by contacting us directly. Opting out will not affect the core functionality of the Software, although it may limit our ability to provide personalized recommendations based on aggregated usage patterns. We respect your choice to opt out and will not penalize you or restrict access to features based on your privacy preferences. If you opt out, we will cease collection of usage data from your installation, although we may retain and continue to use any data collected prior to your opt-out in aggregated, anonymized form.</p>
